:: Shop Bailey Gift
<<effects>>

You walk through the shops, thinking of what Bailey might actually want for Christmas. You know better than to guess wrong.
<br><br>

<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(5000)>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Winter reserve vodka (<<printprice 5000>>)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -5000>><<set $christmas_gift_bailey to "vodka_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a bottle of winter reserve vodka here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printprice 5000>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(25000)>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Snake-shaped fishing lure (<<printprice 25000>>)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -25000>><<set $christmas_gift_bailey to "lure_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a snake-shaped fishing lure here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printprice 25000>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(50000)>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Ebony-and-ivory chessboard (<<printprice 50000>>)|Shop Bailey Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -50000>><<set $christmas_gift_bailey to "chessboard_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy an ebony-and-ivory chessboard here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printprice 50000>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $christmas_bailey_lotus_day gte 0>>
	<span class="blue"><i>You've already given Bailey something that can't be replaced.</i></span>
	<br>
<<elseif $christmas_gift_bailey is "lotus_unwrapped" or $christmas_gift_bailey is "lotus">>
	<span class="blue"><i>You could buy Bailey a different gift, or finish your floral arrangement in your room.</i></span>
	<br>
<<elseif $plants_known and $plants_known.includes("lotus") and (($foodstuff and $foodstuff["lotus"] and $foodstuff["lotus"].amount gte 1) or ($plants and $plants["lotus"] and $plants["lotus"].amount gte 1))>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(5000)>>
		<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Find supplies to arrange with your lotus flower (<<printprice 5000>>)|Shop Bailey Lotus]]>><<pass 10>><<money -5000>><<set $christmas_gift_bailey to "lotus_unwrapped">><<if $foodstuff and $foodstuff["lotus"]>><<set $foodstuff["lotus"].amount -= 1>><<elseif $plants and $plants["lotus"]>><<set $plants["lotus"].amount -= 1>><</if>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You could buy floral arrangement supplies here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printprice 5000>>).</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue"><i>Maybe you could grow something for Bailey...</i></span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Shop Bailey Christmas
<<effects>>

You make your purchase. <<if $christmas_wrap is undefined>>Now you just need wrapping paper.<<else>>You can wrap it in your room.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Shop Bailey Lotus
<<effects>>

You find a slender vase, a spool of ribbon, and some filler flowers to complement your lotus flower. Everything you need for a floral arrangement. <<if $christmas_wrap is undefined>>Now you just need wrapping paper.<<else>>You can wrap it in your room.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Bedroom Bailey Wrap
<<effects>><<wearProp "giftbox">><<speechresolve>>
<<if $christmas_gift_bailey is "lotus_unwrapped" or $christmas_gift_bailey is "lotus">>
<<pass 20>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You rearrange the lotus several times while wondering how Bailey will react. After tying the ribbon for the third time, you carefully write <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> name on the card and place the gift under the tree.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You trim the stems to an even height and turn the open flower towards the front. A neat ribbon holds the arrangement together, with Bailey's name written clearly on the attached card.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You copy the wrapping used on the other gifts, checking each fold before you tie the lotus in place. Once Bailey's name is on the card, you set it beneath the tree and leave it untouched.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You arrange the lotus so the flower remains visible, then secure it with a single ribbon. Satisfied with the result, you label it for Bailey and place it under the tree.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You work quickly, but the lotus still looks better than you expected when you finish. You knot the ribbon, scrawl Bailey's name on the card, then put it under the tree before you reconsider the gift.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You bind the stems with a tight knot and press Bailey's name into the card hard enough to mark the paper beneath it. The finished gift goes at the back of the tree, where <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> will have to look for it.
<<else>>
	You set the stems at the same height, tie the lotus with a ribbon, then write Bailey's name on the card. Once everything is secure, you place the gift under the tree.
<</if>>
<<else>>
You wrap Bailey's gift as neatly as you can manage. Bailey's name is written on the front in your handwriting. You place it under the plastic tree in the main hall.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
